sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as Browser / Mobile Client
    participant Frontend as Next.js Service (api-client.ts)
    participant Middleware as RequestIDMiddleware & CORS
    participant Handler as API Endpoint & Handlers

    Browser->>Frontend: User action / health poll
    Frontend->>Middleware: fetch('/api/v1/...') [Optional X-Request-ID]
    Middleware->>Middleware: Validate / Generate UUID request_id
    Middleware->>Handler: Dispatch endpoint handler
    alt Successful Execution
        Handler-->>Middleware: Business DTO / Payload
        Middleware-->>Frontend: HTTP 200 + Enveloped APIResponse<T> + X-Request-ID header
    else Managed Error / Validation
        Handler-->>Middleware: HTTPException / RequestValidationError
        Middleware-->>Frontend: HTTP 4xx + Sanitized APIResponse<null>
    else Uncaught Exception
        Handler-->>Middleware: Exception
        Middleware-->>Frontend: HTTP 500 + INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR (Masked diagnostic)
    end
    Frontend-->>Browser: Render UI / State Update
